subckt gmc_sink (VSS inp inn vbn outn outp)
MA (outn inp net1 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.5 w=96 nf=8 m=1
MB (outp inn net0 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8_lvt l=0.5 w=96 nf=8 m=1
MTA (net1 vbn VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=16 nf=2 m=1
MTB (net0 vbn VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=16 nf=2 m=1
RDEG (net0 net1) resistor r=8k
